  "duration_s": 397.502993,
  "text_source": "FunASR转录，未全量逐字听核；时间为模型估计",
  "core_text": "上集，咱们盘了第十道，第六，有人说山海关哪，嘉峪关哪，函谷关哪？别急，今天这集就是第五道第一，一个比一个震撼。最后那个两千三百年来，谁想从他身上过都得先留下一条命。老规矩，开讲之前，麻烦您扣个一点个红心，让我看看都是谁在听。第五名，雁门关在山西忻州代县横山山脉中，这关最绝的是他打了两千多年的仗。战国的时候，李牧守雁门大破匈奴，十万骑兵。秦朝的时候，蒙恬从雁门出塞打匈奴。汉朝的时候，卫青、霍去病、李广都从雁门出关。北宋的时候，杨家将一门忠烈杨业带着儿子们守雁门，金沙滩，一战七个儿子死的死伞的伞，杨叶绝食殉国，两千多年雁门关的每一块砖都浸着血，您说这是官还是颁部？中国军事史第四名，嘉峪关在甘肃河西走廊最西端，明长城的最西端。这官最绝的是他是中原的西大门，从嘉峪关往西，就是西域，守住嘉峪关就守住了中原的西大门。他修在河西走廊最窄的地方，南边是祁连山，北边是黑山，中间只有十五公里。嘉峪关就卡在这十五公里的正中间，把整条河西走廊掐得死死的。明朝修嘉峪关，修了一百六十八年、关城瓮城罗城外城一层套一层城墙上能跑马城楼，能驻兵关外，还修了六十里的长城，跟关城连在一起。您说这是官还是中原的西大门？第三名，潼关在陕西渭南潼关县、黄河，为何漯河三河交汇处？南边是秦岭，北边是黄河，中间一条路窄到车，不能并排走马，不能并排骑。这关最绝的是他整个防御体系不是一座孤城，是一座城加十二座连城，再加一条净钩。十二、连城沿着秦岭排开，敌人从哪儿绕，都能被发现净钩。在秦岭里划出禁区，不许任何人穿行，防止敌人从山里摸过来。潼观正面，一夫当关万夫莫开。两千年里有记载的战争，打了八十二场，唐朝安史之乱，哥舒汉带着二十万大军守潼关，本来守得住唐玄宗，逼他出关迎战，一出关就败了潼关，一丢长安就保不住了，您说这是关还是唐王朝的催命符？第二名，山海关在河北秦皇岛渤海边上。这关最绝的是他是万里长城的第一关，东边是海，西边是山，中间一条路，窄道只能过一辆车，山海关就卡在这条路上，北边是燕山，南边是渤海，山海之间只有十五公里。山海关正好堵在这十五公里的正中间，把东北进中原的路全掐死了。关成周长四公里，城墙高十四米后七米城楼九座笛台二十六座。明朝修了两百多年，最绝的是老龙头长城的东段，直接伸进渤海，城墙泡在海里，六百多年不塌，山海关还跟一个典故绑在一起。吴三桂冲冠一怒为红颜，打开了山海关，清军入关，明朝灭亡。您说这是关还是决定王朝命运的门？第一名函谷关在河南三门峡灵宝事，这关最绝的是他两千三百年来，一直是中国最硬的关卡。函谷关在地山和黄河之间，一条古道宽不过几米，两边是山，北边是河，一夫当关万夫莫开从战国到秦朝，从汉朝进唐朝，谁想从东边进关中必须过。函谷关。齐国燕国赵国合纵攻秦，每次打到函谷关，都被挡回去秦国人守在关上。看着六国大军在关下扎营就是过不来。函谷关还出了两个过关，紫气东来老子骑青牛过关。关令尹玺看到紫气知道有圣人来了，老子就在函谷关写下了道德经鸡鸣狗盗。孟尝君被秦昭王扣在秦国。手下人学鸡叫骗开了函谷关的城门，逃了出去，一个关出了两个成语，一部道德经，两千三百年。您说从她身上过都得先留下点什么？您说这个第一名服不服？您听出来了没有？这十座关隘没有一座是光靠险出名娘子，光靠的是女人立的黑紫荆关，靠的是王朝的生死门。友谊关靠的是中国人挺直的腰杆。居庸关靠的是北京的北大门，剑门关，靠的是蜀汉最后的骨气。雁门关靠的是半部中国军事史，嘉峪关靠的是中原的西大门。潼关靠的是十二连城的体系。山海关靠的是决定王朝命运，函谷关靠的是两千三百年的印，每一座关隘的厉害之处都不在他有多高，在他守住了什么？点个关注，咱们下期接着聊。",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "v_de64f528f862c6ae_s00001",
      "start_ms": 190,
      "end_ms": 770,
      "text": "上集，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_de64f528f862c6ae_s00002",
      "start_ms": 930,
      "end_ms": 2370,
      "text": "咱们盘了第十道，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_de64f528f862c6ae_s00003",
      "start_ms": 2390,
      "end_ms": 2790,
      "text": "第六，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_de64f528f862c6ae_s00004",
      "start_ms": 3270,
      "end_ms": 5310,
      "text": "有人说山海关哪，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_de64f528f862c6ae_s00005",
      "start_ms": 5510,
      "end_ms": 6450,
      "text": "嘉峪关哪，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_de64f528f862c6ae_s00006",
      "start_ms": 6630,
      "end_ms": 7650,
      "text": "函谷关哪？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_de64f528f862c6ae_s00007",
      "start_ms": 7950,
      "end_ms": 8430,
      "text": "别急，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_de64f528f862c6ae_s00008",
      "start_ms": 8990,
      "end_ms": 11230,
      "text": "今天这集就是第五道第一，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_de64f528f862c6ae_s00009",
      "start_ms": 11590,
      "end_ms": 12850,
      "text": "一个比一个震撼。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_de64f528f862c6ae_s00010",
      "start_ms": 13310,
      "end_ms": 15910,
      "text": "最后那个两千三百年来，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_de64f528f862c6ae_s00011",
      "start_ms": 15950,
      "end_ms": 19010,
      "text": "谁想从他身上过都得先留下一条命。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_de64f528f862c6ae_s00012",
      "start_ms": 19370,
      "end_ms": 19970,
      "text": "老规矩，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_de64f528f862c6ae_s00013",
      "start_ms": 20130,
      "end_ms": 20870,
      "text": "开讲之前，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_de64f528f862c6ae_s00014",
      "start_ms": 21250,
      "end_ms": 23070,
      "text": "麻烦您扣个一点个红心，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_de64f528f862c6ae_s00015",
      "start_ms": 23210,
      "end_ms": 25110,
      "text": "让我看看都是谁在听。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_de64f528f862c6ae_s00016",
      "start_ms": 25470,
      "end_ms": 26130,
      "text": "第五名，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_de64f528f862c6ae_s00017",
      "start_ms": 26510,
      "end_ms": 31690,
      "text": "雁门关在山西忻州代县横山山脉中，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_de64f528f862c6ae_s00018",
      "start_ms": 32250,
      "end_ms": 36010,
      "text": "这关最绝的是他打了两千多年的仗。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_de64f528f862c6ae_s00019",
      "start_ms": 36130,
      "end_ms": 37150,
      "text": "战国的时候，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_de64f528f862c6ae_s00020",
      "start_ms": 37490,
      "end_ms": 40070,
      "text": "李牧守雁门大破匈奴，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_de64f528f862c6ae_s00021",
      "start_ms": 40250,
      "end_ms": 41150,
      "text": "十万骑兵。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_de64f528f862c6ae_s00022",
      "start_ms": 41810,
      "end_ms": 43010,
      "text": "秦朝的时候，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_de64f528f862c6ae_s00023",
      "start_ms": 43190,
      "end_ms": 46290,
      "text": "蒙恬从雁门出塞打匈奴。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_de64f528f862c6ae_s00024",
      "start_ms": 46690,
      "end_ms": 47730,
      "text": "汉朝的时候，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_de64f528f862c6ae_s00025",
      "start_ms": 47850,
      "end_ms": 51870,
      "text": "卫青、霍去病、李广都从雁门出关。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_de64f528f862c6ae_s00026",
      "start_ms": 52190,
      "end_ms": 53110,
      "text": "北宋的时候，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_de64f528f862c6ae_s00027",
      "start_ms": 53290,
      "end_ms": 58210,
      "text": "杨家将一门忠烈杨业带着儿子们守雁门，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_de64f528f862c6ae_s00028",
      "start_ms": 58570,
      "end_ms": 59350,
      "text": "金沙滩，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_de64f528f862c6ae_s00029",
      "start_ms": 59370,
      "end_ms": 62625,
      "text": "一战七个儿子死的死伞的伞，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_de64f528f862c6ae_s00030",
      "start_ms": 62890,
      "end_ms": 64825,
      "text": "杨叶绝食殉国，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_de64f528f862c6ae_s00031",
      "start_ms": 65290,
      "end_ms": 69925,
      "text": "两千多年雁门关的每一块砖都浸着血，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_de64f528f862c6ae_s00032",
      "start_ms": 70740,
      "end_ms": 72860,
      "text": "您说这是官还是颁部？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_de64f528f862c6ae_s00033",
      "start_ms": 72880,
      "end_ms": 74885,
      "text": "中国军事史第四名，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_de64f528f862c6ae_s00034",
      "start_ms": 75120,
      "end_ms": 79235,
      "text": "嘉峪关在甘肃河西走廊最西端，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_de64f528f862c6ae_s00035",
      "start_ms": 79570,
      "end_ms": 80875,
      "text": "明长城的最西端。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_de64f528f862c6ae_s00036",
      "start_ms": 81380,
      "end_ms": 84175,
      "text": "这官最绝的是他是中原的西大门，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_de64f528f862c6ae_s00037",
      "start_ms": 85000,
      "end_ms": 86615,
      "text": "从嘉峪关往西，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_de64f528f862c6ae_s00038",
      "start_ms": 87410,
      "end_ms": 88295,
      "text": "就是西域，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_de64f528f862c6ae_s00039",
      "start_ms": 88730,
      "end_ms": 92655,
      "text": "守住嘉峪关就守住了中原的西大门。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_de64f528f862c6ae_s00040",
      "start_ms": 93130,
      "end_ms": 95605,
      "text": "他修在河西走廊最窄的地方，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_de64f528f862c6ae_s00041",
      "start_ms": 96070,
      "end_ms": 97555,
      "text": "南边是祁连山，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_de64f528f862c6ae_s00042",
      "start_ms": 97880,
      "end_ms": 99005,
      "text": "北边是黑山，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_de64f528f862c6ae_s00043",
      "start_ms": 99290,
      "end_ms": 100675,
      "text": "中间只有十五公里。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_de64f528f862c6ae_s00044",
      "start_ms": 101180,
      "end_ms": 103925,
      "text": "嘉峪关就卡在这十五公里的正中间，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_de64f528f862c6ae_s00045",
      "start_ms": 104600,
      "end_ms": 107475,
      "text": "把整条河西走廊掐得死死的。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_de64f528f862c6ae_s00046",
      "start_ms": 108030,
      "end_ms": 109375,
      "text": "明朝修嘉峪关，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_de64f528f862c6ae_s00047",
      "start_ms": 109730,
      "end_ms": 117620,
      "text": "修了一百六十八年、关城瓮城罗城外城一层套一层城墙上能跑马城楼，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_de64f528f862c6ae_s00048",
      "start_ms": 117620,
      "end_ms": 119290,
      "text": "能驻兵关外，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_de64f528f862c6ae_s00049",
      "start_ms": 119290,
      "end_ms": 120845,
      "text": "还修了六十里的长城，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_de64f528f862c6ae_s00050",
      "start_ms": 121160,
      "end_ms": 122785,
      "text": "跟关城连在一起。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_de64f528f862c6ae_s00051",
      "start_ms": 123180,
      "end_ms": 125805,
      "text": "您说这是官还是中原的西大门？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_de64f528f862c6ae_s00052",
      "start_ms": 126530,
      "end_ms": 127150,
      "text": "第三名，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_de64f528f862c6ae_s00053",
      "start_ms": 127370,
      "end_ms": 131695,
      "text": "潼关在陕西渭南潼关县、黄河，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_de64f528f862c6ae_s00054",
      "start_ms": 132170,
      "end_ms": 134705,
      "text": "为何漯河三河交汇处？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_de64f528f862c6ae_s00055",
      "start_ms": 135170,
      "end_ms": 136145,
      "text": "南边是秦岭，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_de64f528f862c6ae_s00056",
      "start_ms": 136490,
      "end_ms": 137635,
      "text": "北边是黄河，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_de64f528f862c6ae_s00057",
      "start_ms": 138070,
      "end_ms": 140095,
      "text": "中间一条路窄到车，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_de64f528f862c6ae_s00058",
      "start_ms": 140410,
      "end_ms": 142100,
      "text": "不能并排走马，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_de64f528f862c6ae_s00059",
      "start_ms": 142380,
      "end_ms": 143685,
      "text": "不能并排骑。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_de64f528f862c6ae_s00060",
      "start_ms": 144240,
      "end_ms": 149315,
      "text": "这关最绝的是他整个防御体系不是一座孤城，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_de64f528f862c6ae_s00061",
      "start_ms": 149620,
      "end_ms": 152235,
      "text": "是一座城加十二座连城，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_de64f528f862c6ae_s00062",
      "start_ms": 152810,
      "end_ms": 154365,
      "text": "再加一条净钩。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_de64f528f862c6ae_s00063",
      "start_ms": 154840,
      "end_ms": 157445,
      "text": "十二、连城沿着秦岭排开，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_de64f528f862c6ae_s00064",
      "start_ms": 157880,
      "end_ms": 158895,
      "text": "敌人从哪儿绕，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_de64f528f862c6ae_s00065",
      "start_ms": 159200,
      "end_ms": 161350,
      "text": "都能被发现净钩。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_de64f528f862c6ae_s00066",
      "start_ms": 161350,
      "end_ms": 163815,
      "text": "在秦岭里划出禁区，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_de64f528f862c6ae_s00067",
      "start_ms": 164450,
      "end_ms": 165985,
      "text": "不许任何人穿行，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_de64f528f862c6ae_s00068",
      "start_ms": 166440,
      "end_ms": 168835,
      "text": "防止敌人从山里摸过来。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_de64f528f862c6ae_s00069",
      "start_ms": 169880,
      "end_ms": 170985,
      "text": "潼观正面，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_de64f528f862c6ae_s00070",
      "start_ms": 171240,
      "end_ms": 173315,
      "text": "一夫当关万夫莫开。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_de64f528f862c6ae_s00071",
      "start_ms": 174150,
      "end_ms": 176605,
      "text": "两千年里有记载的战争，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_de64f528f862c6ae_s00072",
      "start_ms": 176870,
      "end_ms": 177935,
      "text": "打了八十二场，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_de64f528f862c6ae_s00073",
      "start_ms": 178260,
      "end_ms": 179565,
      "text": "唐朝安史之乱，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_de64f528f862c6ae_s00074",
      "start_ms": 180060,
      "end_ms": 182860,
      "text": "哥舒汉带着二十万大军守潼关，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_de64f528f862c6ae_s00075",
      "start_ms": 183400,
      "end_ms": 185320,
      "text": "本来守得住唐玄宗，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_de64f528f862c6ae_s00076",
      "start_ms": 185400,
      "end_ms": 186640,
      "text": "逼他出关迎战，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_de64f528f862c6ae_s00077",
      "start_ms": 187140,
      "end_ms": 189460,
      "text": "一出关就败了潼关，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_de64f528f862c6ae_s00078",
      "start_ms": 189460,
      "end_ms": 191420,
      "text": "一丢长安就保不住了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_de64f528f862c6ae_s00079",
      "start_ms": 191480,
      "end_ms": 194580,
      "text": "您说这是关还是唐王朝的催命符？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_de64f528f862c6ae_s00080",
      "start_ms": 195640,
      "end_ms": 196340,
      "text": "第二名，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_de64f528f862c6ae_s00081",
      "start_ms": 196360,
      "end_ms": 199740,
      "text": "山海关在河北秦皇岛渤海边上。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_de64f528f862c6ae_s00082",
      "start_ms": 199840,
      "end_ms": 203740,
      "text": "这关最绝的是他是万里长城的第一关，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_de64f528f862c6ae_s00083",
      "start_ms": 204580,
      "end_ms": 205540,
      "text": "东边是海，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_de64f528f862c6ae_s00084",
      "start_ms": 205840,
      "end_ms": 206740,
      "text": "西边是山，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_de64f528f862c6ae_s00085",
      "start_ms": 207080,
      "end_ms": 208060,
      "text": "中间一条路，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_de64f528f862c6ae_s00086",
      "start_ms": 208380,
      "end_ms": 210370,
      "text": "窄道只能过一辆车，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_de64f528f862c6ae_s00087",
      "start_ms": 210610,
      "end_ms": 212510,
      "text": "山海关就卡在这条路上，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_de64f528f862c6ae_s00088",
      "start_ms": 212630,
      "end_ms": 213710,
      "text": "北边是燕山，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_de64f528f862c6ae_s00089",
      "start_ms": 214090,
      "end_ms": 215510,
      "text": "南边是渤海，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_de64f528f862c6ae_s00090",
      "start_ms": 216410,
      "end_ms": 218550,
      "text": "山海之间只有十五公里。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_de64f528f862c6ae_s00091",
      "start_ms": 219350,
      "end_ms": 222750,
      "text": "山海关正好堵在这十五公里的正中间，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_de64f528f862c6ae_s00092",
      "start_ms": 223490,
      "end_ms": 226690,
      "text": "把东北进中原的路全掐死了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_de64f528f862c6ae_s00093",
      "start_ms": 227050,
      "end_ms": 228610,
      "text": "关成周长四公里，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_de64f528f862c6ae_s00094",
      "start_ms": 228990,
      "end_ms": 234230,
      "text": "城墙高十四米后七米城楼九座笛台二十六座。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_de64f528f862c6ae_s00095",
      "start_ms": 234690,
      "end_ms": 236270,
      "text": "明朝修了两百多年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_de64f528f862c6ae_s00096",
      "start_ms": 236790,
      "end_ms": 239595,
      "text": "最绝的是老龙头长城的东段，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_de64f528f862c6ae_s00097",
      "start_ms": 240290,
      "end_ms": 242210,
      "text": "直接伸进渤海，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_de64f528f862c6ae_s00098",
      "start_ms": 242670,
      "end_ms": 244130,
      "text": "城墙泡在海里，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_de64f528f862c6ae_s00099",
      "start_ms": 244610,
      "end_ms": 245870,
      "text": "六百多年不塌，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_de64f528f862c6ae_s00100",
      "start_ms": 246650,
      "end_ms": 249150,
      "text": "山海关还跟一个典故绑在一起。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_de64f528f862c6ae_s00101",
      "start_ms": 249890,
      "end_ms": 252810,
      "text": "吴三桂冲冠一怒为红颜，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_de64f528f862c6ae_s00102",
      "start_ms": 252930,
      "end_ms": 253890,
      "text": "打开了山海关，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_de64f528f862c6ae_s00103",
      "start_ms": 254250,
      "end_ms": 255270,
      "text": "清军入关，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_de64f528f862c6ae_s00104",
      "start_ms": 255610,
      "end_ms": 256630,
      "text": "明朝灭亡。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_de64f528f862c6ae_s00105",
      "start_ms": 257090,
      "end_ms": 260410,
      "text": "您说这是关还是决定王朝命运的门？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_de64f528f862c6ae_s00106",
      "start_ms": 261430,
      "end_ms": 266570,
      "text": "第一名函谷关在河南三门峡灵宝事，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_de64f528f862c6ae_s00107",
      "start_ms": 266830,
      "end_ms": 269925,
      "text": "这关最绝的是他两千三百年来，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_de64f528f862c6ae_s00108",
      "start_ms": 270380,
      "end_ms": 272760,
      "text": "一直是中国最硬的关卡。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_de64f528f862c6ae_s00109",
      "start_ms": 273720,
      "end_ms": 276880,
      "text": "函谷关在地山和黄河之间，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_de64f528f862c6ae_s00110",
      "start_ms": 277140,
      "end_ms": 280000,
      "text": "一条古道宽不过几米，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_de64f528f862c6ae_s00111",
      "start_ms": 280300,
      "end_ms": 281320,
      "text": "两边是山，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_de64f528f862c6ae_s00112",
      "start_ms": 281980,
      "end_ms": 282920,
      "text": "北边是河，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_de64f528f862c6ae_s00113",
      "start_ms": 283440,
      "end_ms": 288020,
      "text": "一夫当关万夫莫开从战国到秦朝，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_de64f528f862c6ae_s00114",
      "start_ms": 288320,
      "end_ms": 290160,
      "text": "从汉朝进唐朝，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_de64f528f862c6ae_s00115",
      "start_ms": 290560,
      "end_ms": 294000,
      "text": "谁想从东边进关中必须过。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_de64f528f862c6ae_s00116",
      "start_ms": 294060,
      "end_ms": 294715,
      "text": "函谷关。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_de64f528f862c6ae_s00117",
      "start_ms": 295390,
      "end_ms": 299110,
      "text": "齐国燕国赵国合纵攻秦，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_de64f528f862c6ae_s00118",
      "start_ms": 299490,
      "end_ms": 301030,
      "text": "每次打到函谷关，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_de64f528f862c6ae_s00119",
      "start_ms": 301270,
      "end_ms": 304310,
      "text": "都被挡回去秦国人守在关上。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_de64f528f862c6ae_s00120",
      "start_ms": 304690,
      "end_ms": 308030,
      "text": "看着六国大军在关下扎营就是过不来。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_de64f528f862c6ae_s00121",
      "start_ms": 308490,
      "end_ms": 310410,
      "text": "函谷关还出了两个过关，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_de64f528f862c6ae_s00122",
      "start_ms": 310870,
      "end_ms": 314490,
      "text": "紫气东来老子骑青牛过关。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_de64f528f862c6ae_s00123",
      "start_ms": 315370,
      "end_ms": 319210,
      "text": "关令尹玺看到紫气知道有圣人来了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_de64f528f862c6ae_s00124",
      "start_ms": 319490,
      "end_ms": 323530,
      "text": "老子就在函谷关写下了道德经鸡鸣狗盗。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_de64f528f862c6ae_s00125",
      "start_ms": 324290,
      "end_ms": 327320,
      "text": "孟尝君被秦昭王扣在秦国。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_de64f528f862c6ae_s00126",
      "start_ms": 327920,
      "end_ms": 331880,
      "text": "手下人学鸡叫骗开了函谷关的城门，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_de64f528f862c6ae_s00127",
      "start_ms": 332300,
      "end_ms": 333140,
      "text": "逃了出去，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_de64f528f862c6ae_s00128",
      "start_ms": 333360,
      "end_ms": 335400,
      "text": "一个关出了两个成语，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_de64f528f862c6ae_s00129",
      "start_ms": 335880,
      "end_ms": 337140,
      "text": "一部道德经，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_de64f528f862c6ae_s00130",
      "start_ms": 337560,
      "end_ms": 338940,
      "text": "两千三百年。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_de64f528f862c6ae_s00131",
      "start_ms": 339840,
      "end_ms": 343960,
      "text": "您说从她身上过都得先留下点什么？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_de64f528f862c6ae_s00132",
      "start_ms": 344220,
      "end_ms": 346420,
      "text": "您说这个第一名服不服？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_de64f528f862c6ae_s00133",
      "start_ms": 346600,
      "end_ms": 347920,
      "text": "您听出来了没有？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_de64f528f862c6ae_s00134",
      "start_ms": 348220,
      "end_ms": 353480,
      "text": "这十座关隘没有一座是光靠险出名娘子，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_de64f528f862c6ae_s00135",
      "start_ms": 353480,
      "end_ms": 356730,
      "text": "光靠的是女人立的黑紫荆关，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_de64f528f862c6ae_s00136",
      "start_ms": 356730,
      "end_ms": 358615,
      "text": "靠的是王朝的生死门。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_de64f528f862c6ae_s00137",
      "start_ms": 359240,
      "end_ms": 363085,
      "text": "友谊关靠的是中国人挺直的腰杆。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_de64f528f862c6ae_s00138",
      "start_ms": 363620,
      "end_ms": 366665,
      "text": "居庸关靠的是北京的北大门，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_de64f528f862c6ae_s00139",
      "start_ms": 367550,
      "end_ms": 368370,
      "text": "剑门关，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_de64f528f862c6ae_s00140",
      "start_ms": 368370,
      "end_ms": 370975,
      "text": "靠的是蜀汉最后的骨气。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_de64f528f862c6ae_s00141",
      "start_ms": 371770,
      "end_ms": 374585,
      "text": "雁门关靠的是半部中国军事史，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_de64f528f862c6ae_s00142",
      "start_ms": 375370,
      "end_ms": 378025,
      "text": "嘉峪关靠的是中原的西大门。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_de64f528f862c6ae_s00143",
      "start_ms": 378510,
      "end_ms": 381125,
      "text": "潼关靠的是十二连城的体系。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_de64f528f862c6ae_s00144",
      "start_ms": 381830,
      "end_ms": 385065,
      "text": "山海关靠的是决定王朝命运，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_de64f528f862c6ae_s00145",
      "start_ms": 385510,
      "end_ms": 388450,
      "text": "函谷关靠的是两千三百年的印，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_de64f528f862c6ae_s00146",
      "start_ms": 388690,
      "end_ms": 392535,
      "text": "每一座关隘的厉害之处都不在他有多高，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_de64f528f862c6ae_s00147",
      "start_ms": 392960,
      "end_ms": 394375,
      "text": "在他守住了什么？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_de64f528f862c6ae_s00148",
      "start_ms": 394700,
      "end_ms": 395445,
      "text": "点个关注，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_de64f528f862c6ae_s00149",
      "start_ms": 395860,
      "end_ms": 397385,
      "text": "咱们下期接着聊。"
    }
  ],
